  "content": "\n\n<p>另一個實驗即將開始。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;無需 Geckolib</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>*這是我的實驗性專案，尚未平衡</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">來自先前模組的實驗性生物Boss，即將重做</span></p>\n<p>Boss背景音樂來源：makai symphony 的《end of the world》</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>實體：</p>\n<p>審查者（第一個被創造的實體）</p>\n<p>毒瘴（不會生成，僅為佔位符）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">特殊日子將觸發搞笑事件</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">研究員：次元旅人</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">生命值：450</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">進入第二階段時，請注意禁止治療</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1135/269/310/172/inresearcher.gif\" alt=\"Researcherp1\" width=\"310\" height=\"170\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">-------預計新增的生物------</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">目前製作中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">需要 Bloody Shogun 模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/1/d/12ASosU75xb7IJjDuyjt0O7tFJdQQlc1W=w1920-h945-iv1?auditContext=prefetch\" alt=\"furious.gif 표시 중\" width=\"416\" height=\"244\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">小丑騎士-幾乎完成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/1/d/1v_zga0cSmFyfu4tz_peajM3jKuXEllsy=w1920-h945-iv1?auditContext=prefetch\" alt=\"mojester_knight.gif 표시 중\" width=\"351\" height=\"192\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#999;text-decoration:underline\">*原本計畫放在實驗性Boss中，但已移至獨立模組。</span></span></strong></p>\n<del style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em>???-輝煌戰士-</em></span><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/1/d/1251HN7PziuaK-sSP4CUgsIxmuPmKemEV=w1920-h945-iv1?auditContext=prefetch\" alt=\"1nlychnus.gif 표시 중\" width=\"300\" height=\"155\"></span></del></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
